# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
#
# design-system/ is the internal component library: eleven preview pages plus a
# manifest and an inventory stylesheet. Pages deploys the whole repo root, so
# they were live and crawlable at guardiandigitalstudios.com/design-system/...
# (verified: /design-system/components/nav.html returned 200 in production).
#
# 301 rather than 404, because a redirect is the stronger deindex signal for
# URLs that may already be in an index, and there is no 404 page to serve.
# _headers also marks the path noindex, which is what holds if Cloudflare
# resolves a static asset ahead of a redirect rule for a path that exists.
/design-system/*  /  301
